            <title>[ZEPPELIN-5810] jupyter-client and jupyter_client</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-5810</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;I noticed that the package name jupyter-client has been changed to jupyter_client in my environment.&lt;br/&gt;
Zeppelin performs a check for jupyter-client, but not for jupyter_client. Therefore, Zeppelin thinks that the requirements are not met.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
